The */test_<service>.ae files here are ported from testcontainers-go's module
tests (https://github.com/testcontainers/testcontainers-go, MIT, portions
copyright (c) 2017-2019 Gianluca Arbezzano and the testcontainers-go
contributors), by way of testcontainers-ae
(https://github.com/servirtium/testcontainers-ae, MIT), where they lived until
2026-11-07. testcontainers-go's licence is in LICENSE.testcontainers-go.
consul/, meilisearch/, nginx/ and registry/testdata/ and
clickhouse/testdata/init-db.sh come from the same modules' testdata/ in
testcontainers-go; rabbitmq/testdata/placeholder.pem was written for
testcontainers-ae.

The tapes (*.md beside each test) are recordings of the named container
images' responses.

The tapes record interactions with third-party software: each is subject to
that software's licence and its vendor's terms, as listed in
UPSTREAM-TERMS.md, and a tape whose service has restrictive terms starts with
a "## LICENSE NOTICE" naming them. Anyone using the tapes is bound by those
terms, including any restriction on reverse engineering. For dynamodb/,
pinecone/ and timeplus/, whose terms plausibly forbid publishing recordings,
no tapes are shipped (see LICENCE-NOTE.md in each).
